WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.002
-Hey, everyone.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.105
Tonight is a very special
Edition of "The Tonight Show.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.839
We're lucky enough to do
our show every night here

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:09.275
in 30 Rockefeller Center
in New York City.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.711
Normally, we're in Studio 6b
just inside these doors,

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.314
but tonight we're going
to change things up.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:17.550
We're going to do something that
we've always wanted to do.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.519
We're taking "The Tonight Show"
underground

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.420
to the New York City subway.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.589
Our only guest tonight is one
of the biggest bands

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:26.292
in the world,
BTS are on the show.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.593
They're going to ride
the subway with me.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:28.694
They've never written before.

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:29.929
We're going to get
something to eat

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.031
and then we're going
to Grand Central Terminal.

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.832
They are shutting it down
for us

00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:36.969
because BTS will put willing
on an epic performance.

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:38.704
Nothing like this
has ever been down before.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:40.439
It's all happening tonight,
but first,

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.442
we have to get to the train.
Let's go.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.310
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.112
♪♪

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.214
-From the F train below
Rockefeller Center

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.015
in the New York subway system.

00:00:50.015 --> 00:00:53.853
It's "The Tonight Show Starring
Jimmy Fallon."

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.488
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:59.025
-Tonight joining Jimmy
and his guest, BTS.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.494
And featuring
the legendary Roots crew.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:05.198
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.434
-And now, here's your host,

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.970
Jimmy Fallon.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.673
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:22.515
♪♪

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:23.749
-Welcome.

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:27.686
Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everybody.

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:29.923
Yes.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.791
Guys, I'm so excited about this.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.026
BTS is my guest tonight.

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.196
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.033
This is very historic
because this is the first time

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.768
New Yorkers
have been excited to see

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.836
seven guys get on
a packed subway,

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:44.938
so thank you for that.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.239
Can you hear me in the back?

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.674
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:51.144
We are making TV history
as the first in late night

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.945
to do a show on the subway.

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.380
It's exciting
because if it goes well,

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.748
NBC is going to move
the fifth hour

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:56.916
of the "Today" show down here.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.018
So that's good, yeah.
This is incredible.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.187
We really are doing the
monologue on the subway.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.522
We actually wanted
to this last week,

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.724
but the train never showed up.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.459
But seriously, tonight
is going to be so much fun.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.261
We're going to spend
one hour together,

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.697
or as it's known on
the subway, two stops.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:13.066
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.267
It's great to be down here,
though.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.536
It's cramped, it's loud
and there's no view.

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.004
If this were a New York City
apartment,

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.572
it'd be 3,000 bucks a month.
You know that?

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.341
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:23.643
But I'm excited to do a show
on the subway,

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.012
although I'm not really here
by choice.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.013
Unfortunately,
NBC lost their entire budget

00:02:28.013 --> 00:02:31.451
on the movie "Cats"
and this is all we can afford.

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:33.386
I would have to say I love
New York City so much.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.289
We are the home of all the best
parades, right?

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.458
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.594
The St. Patricks Day parade,
the Thanksgiving, Pride,

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.429
the list goes,
and actually a long,

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.498
long, time ago,
we eve had parades

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.266
for our winning sports teams.

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:49.168
It was a magical,
magical moment.

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:52.171
[ Audience boos ]
-Don't you make fun of the Mets.

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:53.972
-You can't throw me off,
it's a moving train.

00:02:53.972 --> 00:02:55.107
I'm stuck here.

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.542
Another thing I love
about the city

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:57.710
is that it's so modern.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.244
For instance,
instead of a torch,

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:01.513
the Statue of Liberty now holds
a giant vape pen.

00:03:01.513 --> 00:03:02.949
Isn't that cool?
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.817
And there's so many exciting
things happening in New York.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.386
In fact, out of the 40,000
airports in the world,

00:03:07.386 --> 00:03:09.856
LaGuardia is very close
to becoming one of them.

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.191
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:14.126
Finally, you guys, I just want
to say through it all,

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:16.429
New Yorkers are really just
one huge family --

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:19.098
We argue, we fight,
at the end of the day,

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:21.534
we all come together
to make fun of New Jersey.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.603
[ Cheers and applause ]

